{"id":"vod_md_6655","vodId":"6655","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"命运石之门","name_cn":"命运石之门","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231117-1/33a779a7391c5cb6ef2c4638d698a7bb.jpg"},"summary":"本作主人公冈部伦太郎（宫野真守 配音）是个患有严重中二病的大学生，自称为“凤凰院凶真”的他和伙伴们组成了“未来发明研究所”，在位于秋叶原的一个简陋实验室内进行各种古怪发明和调查。2010年7月28日这天，冈部和青梅竹马真由理（花泽香菜 配音）一同去了科学讲义会场，在那里，他们遇见了天才少女牧濑红莉栖（今井麻美 配音）。让人意想不到的事情发生了，冈部在会馆楼道内听到一声惨叫，他闻声而至，发现了倒在血泊中的牧濑。冈部用手机短信将这件事告诉好友桥田至，这个举动，让世界都颠覆了。实验室里那个所谓的“未来道具”，竟然真的可以左右世界的进程，冈部自此成了孤独的观测者。这一切都是命运石之门的选择。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-17 09:53:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/yiRQENXu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/rBi3S9LN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/ciNz697K/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/cgDrgySB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/Hm97Z7f9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/dMKcbBK9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/tkixBx35/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/g3MeugF1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/fQgH9tgQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/tj0E4hc9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/znWRDXzA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/40myM36M/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/srrOCWPO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/zsZQQeLA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231116/6qRLUxnj/index.m3u8"},